  "description": "WPF spreadsheet control built for 10M-row business datasets. Viewport DrawingVisual rendering, compiled dynamic row/column styles, multi-core parallel filtering/sorting/find, viewport on-demand auto-merge & fluent 2D/multi-column computed cell merges (HorizontalFirst/VerticalFirst Grid + Sum/Subtract/Multiply/Divide/Compute), multilevel merged headers, frozen columns, 5M-row live CRUD & undo, high-density ColumnarSheetTable, and live summaries. 问题反馈/联系邮箱: 2285161881@qq.com",
